- [38;5;10mcontinue[0m does re-test the condition.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
I translated this into an explicit four-state machine ([38;5;10mLoopCond[0m, [38;5;10mLoopTop[0m, [38;5;10mLabel1[0m, [38;5;10mLabel2[0m) where each state transition mirrors one C label/fallthrough, so the condition-test skipping is preserved rather than "fixed."[0m[0m
